# ─── Credentials. Never commit any of these. ─────────────────────────────────
# The signing material for this app lives in GitHub Actions secrets and on your
# Mac, never in the repository. See docs/ios-release-setup.md.
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pem
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
key.properties
**/android/key.properties
**/android/app/*.jks
**/android/app/upload_certificate.pem
GoogleService-Info.plist
google-services.json
.env
.env.*

# ─── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties

# ─── IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# ─── Claude Code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# ─── Local-only files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tests stay on disk but are not pushed; no CI workflow runs them.
bijbelstudie_mobile/test/
# All-caps planning docs in the root. Listed explicitly because Windows git
# matches case-insensitively, so a [A-Z] pattern would also hit README/CLAUDE.
/*_PLAN.md
/APP_STORE_MONETISATION.md
branding/social/
